  "acceptedPolicy": [
    "Lookup conversion replaces/deletes matched unknown. Original0x1bd2b4..0x1bd306 sets owner only for head replacement; non-head owner is not repaired.",
    "Conversion copies count/transform before virtual Read and ignores bool. Original0x2c9ae3..0x2c9b23 does not test Read result;0x2c9aaa moves converted pointer to RAX before cookie check.",
    "Unknown validity requires base validity, positive declared size, nonnull buffer and nonnil original class UUID unequal to unknown runtime class.",
    "Unknown constructor duplicates buffer/class/version only for nonzero copied count and source size/buffer. Ineligible constructor retains base IDs with empty unknown fields.",
    "Unknown assignment copies source IDs/app after base assignment and clears userdata ID/unknown fields when ineligible, retaining owner/next.",
    "String-list copies actual ordered pairs; base assignment retains destination IDs. Default ID/app/count corroborated.",
    "Original5 purge retains head until END and samples leak flag for EACH node. Published6 clears head first and samples deletion once; this is not substituted."
  ],
